    "Black & White" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "白黒"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黑白"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Black and White lift the endpoint slopes. Shadows and Highlight independently shape the curve before and after Tone while keeping its brightness and slope fixed. Increasing Shadows concentrates the shadow-side adjustment toward Tone; increasing Highlight extends the highlight-side adjustment away from Tone. Both at 50%, with Black and White at 0%, reproduce the original beta curve. The graph shows the neutral SDR tone curve from black to the white point." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黒と白は両端の傾きを引き上げます。シャドウとハイライトは、トーン位置の明るさと傾きを保ちながら、その前後のカーブを個別に調整します。シャドウを上げると暗部の調整がトーン付近に集中し、ハイライトを上げると明部の調整がトーンから広がります。両方を50%、黒と白を0%にすると元のベータカーブを再現します。グラフは黒から白点までのニュートラルなSDRトーンカーブです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黑和白提高两端的斜率。阴影和高光分别调整色调前后的曲线，同时保持色调处的亮度和斜率不变。提高阴影会使暗部调整向色调集中；提高高光会使亮部调整从色调向外延伸。两者均为 50%、黑和白均为 0% 时，重现原始贝塔曲线。图表显示从黑色到白点的中性 SDR 色调曲线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blue" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "青"
